      "text": "```\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    SOIL SCIENCE LANDSCAPE                            |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                      |\n|  PEDOLOGY               SOIL PHYSICS           SOIL CHEMISTRY        |\n|  +-----------+          +----------+           +----------+          |\n|  | Formation |          | Texture  |           | CEC      |          |\n|  | Horizons  |  <---->  | Structure|  <---->   | pH       |          |\n|  | CLORPT    |          | Porosity |           | Nutrients|          |\n|  | Taxonomy  |          | Water    |           | Redox    |          |\n|  +-----------+          +----------+           +----------+          |\n|        |                     |                      |                |\n|        v                     v                      v                |\n|  SOIL BIOLOGY          NUTRIENT CYCLING       EROSION/DEGRADATION    |\n|  +-----------+          +----------+           +----------+          |\n|  | Bacteria  |          | N cycle  |           | USLE     |          |\n|  | Fungi     |          | P cycle  |           | Saliniz. |          |\n|  | Mycorrhiza|          | C cycling|           | Compact. |          |\n|  | Food web  |          | Fixation |           | Desertif.|          |\n|  +-----------+          +----------+           +----------+          |\n|                                                                      |\n|  SOIL MANAGEMENT:  Tillage systems, cover crops, biochar, C seq.    |\n|                                                                      |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
