      "text": "ABOVE GROUND BIOMASS\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  LITTER / ORGANIC HORIZON (O)  : 0–5 cm\n  TOPSOIL (A horizon)           : 0–30 cm      <-- most biologically active\n  SUBSOIL (B horizon)           : 30–100 cm    <-- accumulation zone\n  WEATHERED PARENT MATERIAL (C) : 0.5–5 m      <-- active weathering front\n  SAPROLITE (partially weathered): up to 10–30 m\n  FRESH BEDROCK (R)             :              <-- ultimate mineral source\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  GROUNDWATER ZONE               : depth variable"
