      "text": "| Metric | Value | Context |\n|--------|-------|---------|\n| Global soil carbon stock (to 1 m depth) | ~1,500 Gt C | ~2× atmospheric CO2 carbon |\n| Global soil carbon stock (to 2 m depth) | ~2,400 Gt C | Includes deep mineral-bound C |\n| Soil organic carbon (top 30 cm) | ~700 Gt C | Most biologically active fraction |\n| Bacterial cells per gram of soil | 10⁸–10⁹ cells | More bacteria in teaspoon of soil than people on Earth |\n| Fungal hyphae per gram of soil | ~100–200 m | Vast hyphal network |\n| Earthworm cast production | 10–40 tonnes/ha/yr | Most productive agricultural soils |\n| Rate of topsoil loss (global cultivated) | ~10–40 t/ha/yr | T factor in RUSLE |\n| Time to form 1 cm of soil | ~100–1,000 yr | Context: erosion removes 1 cm in 1–10 yr under cultivation |\n| Global degraded land | ~2 billion ha | ~1/3 of cultivated land area |\n| Soil biodiversity | >10,000 species per 10 g sample | Most species undescribed |"
